window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It might be Halloween, but that doesn’t mean it’s all fun and games for Detective Kate Rosetti. First, a man arrives at the precinct, willing to speak to nobody but Kate. When this curious stranger confesses to a very unique murder, Kate is prepared to arrest him except for one problem. . .</p> <p>There is no body. There are no witnesses. In fact, there’s no evidence a crime has been committed at all. Is this the start to a deadly disaster. . . or one man’s attempt to play a disturbing game?</p> <p>As Kate works to unravel the mystery behind one man’s curious confession, she’s drawn into a funeral that quickly turns suspicious. With two cases heating up, and her love life not far behind, can the detective manage to balance it all—or is a happy ending for Kate forever out of reach?</p>"; 
